<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Thursday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Thursday's est 95,000, Wk ago 108,000, and Yr ago 103,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs.</p>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower compared with mid-session Wednesday. Trade was slow to moderate for light demand and offerings. Top $54.50 per cwt.</p>
